WEBVTT

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:05.870
Wait!

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:09.140
Don't get in my way!

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:11.350
Listen to me, Yasusuke!

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:13.320
Seimei is still alive.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:16.490
Even while surrounded by darkness, she's waiting for me to save her!

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:18.360
You're still saying such things?!

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.650
Revenge for my brother!

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:31.570
You win.

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:37.450
I promise you. I will no longer lay a hand on her.

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:41.450
In exchange, you have to shoulder everything.

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:42.880
Understand?

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:48.290
The time of Rudra's awakening is close.

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:53.360
The preparations are complete.

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:55.730
Inform Haruaki of this.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.130
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:00.430
Look!

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:10.750
Raiko!

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:12.750
The preparations are complete!

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:13.980
Huh?

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:16.750
Bring Kaguya to my dwelling!

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:25.920
<i>The white lotus flower blooms</i>

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:32.630
<i>The key to the bright night sky appears</i>

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:38.270
<i>And now the hazy barrier fades away</i>

00:01:38.270 --> 00:01:43.410
<i>The unstoppable fate of time</i>

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:47.970
<i>The ever repeating link</i>

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:55.620
<i>Madder red clouds are swallowed up by darkness</i>

00:01:55.620 --> 00:02:00.860
<i>Swirling desire gives it strength</i>

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:06.870
<i>A darkness that even provokes this love</i>

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:08.870
<i>Quick as lightning</i>

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:11.970
<i>Illusions, show your true form</i>

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:17.180
<i>Sky, storm violently</i>

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:22.820
<i>As the fang of steel shines with a golden gleam</i>

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:32.820
<i>Why do people yearn for love so much</i> <i>their souls become dyed with crimson?</i>

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:38.870
<i>Protect it to the end!</i>

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:41.570
<i>Toward the light of the pure white lotus.</i>

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:45.840
<i>AH... GARO</i>

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:47.020
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:52.020
"RESONANCE"

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.900
What's wrong, Golden Knight?

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:17.240
Have you even lost the will to fight?

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:37.760
Did you think you could escape so easily?

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:47.900
You...?!

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:02.950
What is the meaning of this?!

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:06.050
Do you think I would be defeated by such petty tricks?

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:08.790
I never planned to defeat you in that form from the beginning.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:10.950
Something like this!

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:15.290
Haruaki-<i>sama</i>, it will not hold for long.

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:31.280
What are you doing, old fool?

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:33.440
Are you prepared?

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.080
Yes.

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:42.690
Inside Seimei's heart?

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:44.660
Correct.

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:49.000
Rudra has bound Kiyome's spirit, and we must attack him directly.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.670
Huh?!

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:54.440
And, I believe the only one who can enter Kiyome's heart is you,

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:57.710
whom she trusts most of all.

00:04:57.710 --> 00:05:04.150
However, you, too, will never return if you should fail.

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:06.110
If that happens...

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:13.690
I will go.

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:14.990
Yes.

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:16.820
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:20.160
Don't worry. I'll be sure to return here with Seimei.

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:22.360
Then, I will follow you!

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:23.160
No need.

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:24.670
Why not?!

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:28.870
Kintoki, it's true that I'm still inexperienced

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:32.070
and could not even don my armor on my own.

00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:34.580
Even though I'm like this,

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:38.850
I want to be a man that does not shame the Golden Knight lineage.

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:42.380
Can't you leave this to me?

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:47.760
Gallantry is not arrogance.

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:50.220
As you wish!

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:53.560
I would like you to fulfill a different role.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:54.530
Yes!

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:58.520
We need the combined strength of everyone here.

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:27.700
Haruaki-<i>sama</i>!

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:28.920
Haruaki-<i>sama.</i>

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:36.560
Kiyome...

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:03.620
Seimei...

00:07:28.360 --> 00:07:29.980
Seimei!

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:35.130
Seimei! Seimei!

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.500
Seimei, it's me!

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:50.340
Raiko...

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:52.010
Raiko?!

00:07:52.010 --> 00:07:55.780
Raiko, thank you for com...

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:10.390
Don't move!

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:22.710
Are you all right?

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:24.680
I...

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:26.710
You don't have to say anything.

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:30.410
Everyone knows that you didn't want any of that to happen.

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:32.750
Can you stand?

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:34.490
Y-Yeah.

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:37.590
I'm sorry for taking so long.

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:39.090
Well, Grandfather...

00:08:39.090 --> 00:08:41.560
Yeah, he's waiting for you.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:47.200
I see, so he wasn't told.

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:49.700
Let's go home, Seimei.

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:52.770
Raiko, thank you for coming.

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:06.950
Golden Knight...

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:20.600
I will not give up my vessel.

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:21.900
Rudra!

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:26.640
Don't worry. I'll be the one to save you this time...

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:28.410
...as the Golden Knight...

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:31.140
Raiko.

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:39.550
...and, I hope, as your Makai Knight.

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:48.980
That sparkle...

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:57.240
Haruaki-<i>sama</i>!

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:58.670
The two of them are fighting...

00:09:58.670 --> 00:09:59.640
Huh?

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:01.340
...within.

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:03.200
Fool.

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:11.320
She moves on her own when I'm not looking,

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:14.360
even though she is still incomplete.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.360
He came, after all.

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:18.520
Then, I'm off.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:24.430
Boy.

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:28.000
Have you forgotten how you were helplessly beaten half to death?

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.940
Things are different from before!

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.280
Not a single thing has changed!

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:54.210
I definitely can't lose!

00:10:55.160 --> 00:10:59.010
You definitely can't win, you mean.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:34.020
Wh-What?

00:11:34.020 --> 00:11:35.760
What's going on?!

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:37.450
I'm sure you don't understand.

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:45.630
You are inside of me right now.

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:49.270
This is a place where my feelings decide everything.

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:52.510
With Douma Houshi's curse,
I was eaten away by the darkness.

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:57.140
My heart was alone, weak, and fragile enough

00:11:57.140 --> 00:12:02.320
for a Horror like you to enter and take over.

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:03.550
However...

00:12:03.550 --> 00:12:06.320
I have gained the light again.

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:07.990
I can feel the light.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.890
What are you saying?!

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:12.460
I'll say it so you understand.

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:15.020
Get out of my body!

00:12:27.210 --> 00:12:33.010
Bastards!

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:03.610
It can't be!

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:07.580
There's no need for me to defeat you.

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:12.880
If I hold you off long enough, we win...

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:16.120
Bastards!

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:24.700
Bastards! Here and now!
All of you! I will murder you all!

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:27.970
You've done it, Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:54.160
Kintoki, you have done well!

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:58.120
It is my turn now. I will not let you die!

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:03.440
I won't let you escape, rat!

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:05.400
Such annoying tricks.

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:17.250
Wait there until it is your turn to die!

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:20.590
It cannot be helped...

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:30.290
I just need to create another path...

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:35.500
Haruaki-<i>sama</i>!

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:37.300
It is fine!

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:40.930
Do not let your guard down! Keep hold of Kiyome!

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:46.710
I'll praise you for getting this far.

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:48.200
Douman!

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:49.620
I will kill you,

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:53.320
as well as erase the Golden Knight together with the vessel's body.

00:14:53.320 --> 00:14:54.690
Hm?

00:15:00.690 --> 00:15:04.500
So that's how it is.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:08.460
Then I will have you come with me, Abeno Haruaki!

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:11.840
What?!

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:35.060
Goodness, such a persistent man.

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:40.230
Inari-<i>sama.</i>

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:43.040
Pull it together, little bean!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:47.940
We were scolded by our superiors because of you all.

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:49.940
Don't get in my way!

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:53.410
Those are my words, fool.

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:57.080
Everything has gone as Haruaki planned.

00:15:57.080 --> 00:16:00.920
If we lose it now, all will be for naught.

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:17.030
What a terrifying face.

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:49.570
S-So strong.

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:51.440
The little bean is so simple-minded.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.170
Huh?

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:58.250
We only caught him off-guard and managed to swat him away.

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:03.150
Our role is over once those two return.

00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:06.180
Do what you wish after this.

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:36.620
Haruaki-<i>sama</i>!

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:37.950
What of Kiyome?

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:39.990
She is safe.

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:41.820
Kaguya.

00:17:41.820 --> 00:17:44.160
Yes.

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:00.410
Golden Knight-<i>dono...</i>

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:01.240
Yes.

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:03.800
Please take care of Kiyome.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:07.040
Haruaki-<i>sama</i>?

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:09.370
Haruaki-<i>sama</i>!

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:17.020
Haruaki-<i>sama</i>! Haruaki-<i>sama</i>. No way...

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:19.160
Taizan Fukun.

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:20.730
Seimei!

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:27.600
It's normally an <i>onmyou</i> spell used to call back the souls of the dead.

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:32.210
However, you must pay a price of equal value in return.

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:34.440
Price?

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:40.540
In other words, he had to become the vessel himself to call me back.

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:56.220
Kiyome.

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:02.140
Now is not the time to cry.

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:03.600
Grandfather...

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:09.910
You have finally returned to me.

00:19:09.910 --> 00:19:12.380
Sorry. I'm so sorry.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:17.820
Do not worry about it.
I am your grandfather, after all.

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:26.960
Your spell had kept the darkness at bay, little by little...

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:32.970
That's why I was able to hold on until Raiko came for me!

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:37.300
It was the least I could do for you.

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:43.180
If I did not, I would not be able to face your mother and father.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:49.820
Thank everyone for me.

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:51.080
Yeah.

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.960
Now, you know what to do.

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.420
I don't want to.

00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:00.660
Use the power of the Golden Knight to defeat what's inside me.

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:02.830
I don't want to!

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:08.100
Goodness, your stubbornness has never changed.

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:17.310
I don't want to...

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:22.840
Kiyome, can you smile one last time for me?

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:30.520
Grandfather!

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:41.970
Grandfather!

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:45.640
Grandfather!

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:54.740
Grandfather!

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:16.260
If life is not an illusion, death is not nothingness.

00:21:27.710 --> 00:21:32.950
Right now, Rudra is here.

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:38.620
Raiko, please cut down my grandfather!

00:21:47.270 --> 00:21:49.740
Haruaki-<i>sama</i>?

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:53.610
He used his own life to see this to the end.

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:57.980
I see. With this, everything will be over.

00:22:53.270 --> 00:23:01.190
<i>Whilst looking at the filling moon</i>

00:23:01.190 --> 00:23:11.170
<i>Today, as well, I bury these growing feelings</i>

00:23:11.290 --> 00:23:18.330
<i>The skies of fate have split in two</i>

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:24.320
<i>(Shine upon the darkness) Lead me</i>

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:30.670
<i>Yearning for the light, I throw out my heart</i>

00:23:30.670 --> 00:23:35.810
<i>I will always be beside you</i>

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:42.440
<i>So until the last moment of this life</i>

00:23:42.440 --> 00:23:47.650
<i>Let me see this fleeting dream</i>

00:23:50.950 --> 00:24:00.960
"Next Episode: RUDRA"

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:54.290
An awakened beast.

00:23:54.290 --> 00:23:56.290
The tested heart.

00:23:56.290 --> 00:23:59.860
The Crimson Moon grows redder.
